{"id":"r9wumr6yp9fhwmfi6z1icvk1e","title":"香港通过加密资产税务申报法案 分阶段实施信息交换","originalTitle":"香港加密资产申报法案通过，内地居民的交易信息会被交换吗？","summary":"香港通过《2026年税务（修订）条例草案》，计划自2028年起与相关税务管辖区交换加密资产申报信息。法案分阶段实施：2027年1月1日启动服务商资料收集，2028年1月起交换信息，2029年1月1日采用新标准。该安排可能增加内地居民在港交易加密资产的合规成本。","reason":null,"source":{"name":"链捕手 ChainCatcher"},"links":{"original":"https://www.chaincatcher.com/article/2302046"},"publishedAt":"2026-11-05T11:55:24.000Z","discoveredAt":"2026-11-05T12:14:55.400Z","timelineAt":"2026-11-05T12:14:55.400Z","category":"crypto-policy","tags":["监管处罚","政策发布"],"score":85,"selected":false,"channel":"news","story":null,"x":null,"readingMode":"full","author":null,"body":null,"outline":[],"relatedStories":[],"topics":[{"slug":"regulation","name":"监管与政策"}],"indexable":false,"markdownAvailable":true,"group":null,"hasTranslation":false,"bodyLanguage":"original"}